cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: tree-sitter-gnuplot
abstract: >-
  A tree-sitter grammar for gnuplot 6, covering the command set, the shared
  set/show option bodies and gnuplot's keyword abbreviation rules through an
  external scanner. Ships highlight, fold and injection queries, and a keyword
  dictionary consumed by downstream tooling.
type: software
